tyle=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2. 선발 예정 인원 : </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">2명</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">3. 장학금 지급기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">: 재학기간 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">4. 장학 혜택 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 석사과정 기준 월 6000루피 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">- 기타 과정: 붙임 내역 참조</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">5. 지원 자격</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">가. 대한민국 국적소지자로서 심신이 건강한 자 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">나. 병역법 및 해외 유학에 결격 사유가 없는 자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">다. 건강히 유학생활을 영위할 수 있는 자 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">라. 고교성적, 대학평점평균(GPA) 및 영어 우수자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">6. 지원 서류</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">가. 지원서A (본원 소정양식, 한국어) 파일 제출</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">나. 지원서B (인도 제출양식, 사진 부착, 영어) 6부 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">다. 대학 재학(졸업)증명서(영문) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">라. 대학 성적증명서(영문) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">마. 어학 증명서 (MBA, TOEFL, IELTS)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">-사본, 원본 대조필</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">-입학 대학에서 원하는 증명서 제출</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">바. 추천서 (영어) </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">사. 신체 검사서 (소정 양식)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">아. 여권 사본 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">자. 사진 1매 동봉 (사진 뒷면에 영문 이름 명기)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">차. 지원자 DB (시트 2개 있음, 파일 송부함)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">7. 제출 방법 및 기타 사항: 붙임 문서 참조 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\"></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\"></span></p><p clas